{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31568","headline":"石门韦明府爲致东阳潭石鲫鱠 · 李羣玉","name":"石门韦明府爲致东阳潭石鲫鱠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"锦鳞衔饵出清涟，暖日江亭动鱠筵。\n叠雪乱飞消箸底，散丝繁洒拂刀前。\n太湖浪说朱衣鲋，汉浦休夸缩项鳊。\n隽味品流知第一，更劳霜橘助芳鲜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31568.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31568","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}